"Upload theme.css and theme.js to Canvas's Theme Editor (Advanced → CSS / "
"JavaScript) so pantoken's classes are available on every page."
msgstr ""
"Naložite theme.css in theme.js v Canvasov urejevalnik tem (Advanced → CSS / "
"JavaScript), da bodo pantokenove razrede na voljo na vsaki strani."

