"Canvas sanitizes pasted HTML server-side — always verify content pasted from "
"the RCE preview in Canvas."
msgstr ""
"Canvas obdeluje prilepljen HTML na strežniku — vedno preverite vsebino, "
"prilepljeno iz predogleda RCE v Canvasu."

